es":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Mety9u6oVMEBliYTmBZ7Jg","review_id":"mC-FGL2exf4kmRx6M7lcHQ","date":"2008-12-12T08:52:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9664055109024048,"text_excerpt":"Blueberry Mojitos! Believe dat! Yah they are pretty good, kind of tangy, but the ladies love them. This place also has a fine selection of beers on tap, and the patio is top notch. The interior is dimly lit and unassuming, save the few religious artifacts on the walls. Paying respect to St Joe perhaps? It's pretty much the perfect place to just kick back, relax, and have a few drinks. Definitely recommended."},{"business_id":"Mety9u6oVMEBliYTmBZ7Jg","review_id":"AzHo-i476aQCvCETaA0ymg","date":"2013-06-03T23:52:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.958892822265625,"text_excerpt":"Big fan of St. Joes and it has me thinking its been far too long since I have frequented this place. I don't order a mojito normally, but when I'm here i do! They are awesome! I know the blueberry is popular but I stick to the classic as it has never let me down. I like to hang out towards the back in the patio area where you can spread out a little more with some friends. The inside portion doesn't make much sense for groups. Overall, cool little place on Magazine to grab a drink."},{"business_id":"Mety9u6oVMEBliYTmBZ7Jg","review_id":"7GhFJxna7s-oo0Kv1hOzzA","date":"2011-08-29T16:53:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.951082706451416,"text_excerpt":"This is one of several spots that are great on a relatively laid-back Magazine night. It's a bit on the uptown side of most of the bars so it takes a little commitment, but I think it's worth it. There is a comfortable back patio and good drinks. The mojitos are really great, and I'm not a rum drinker...at all. Favorites are: Blueberry mojito"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Mety9u6oVMEBliYTmBZ7Jg","photo_id":"e_pgJXZ3v6SddSsxUpC5Hw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/e_pgJXZ3v6SddSsxUpC5Hw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9267047643661499},{"business_id":"Mety9u6oVMEBliYTmBZ7Jg","photo_id":"lppUcOKPtviwkquEMuSNoA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/lppUcOKPtviwkquEMuSNoA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8409822583198547},{"business_id":"Mety9u6oVMEBliYTmBZ7Jg","photo_id":"WrhwDc1bVhzEjxd4wBIV7Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WrhwDc1bVhzEjxd4wBIV7Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8260190486907959},{"business_id":"Mety9u6oVMEBliYTmBZ7Jg","photo_id":"KtZW6p1m3pRZdBDdmKbSHg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/KtZW6p1m3pRZdBDdmKbSHg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7848434448242188}]},"notebook_case":null}
